"customSetting_coAlert_desc" = "Dear users, Hello:\nIn order to better serve users and provide more professional futures services, the new web version and APP version of the perpetual futures will be launched soon.\n1. Before the official switch, we provide a dual-version futures system for you to use. At the same time, when the new futures is just launched, there may be many imperfections. If you find a bug or any suggestion, please submit it through the link:\n2. At that time, the old futures system will stop accessing. Users of the old futures must close their positions in time and transfer their assets to the spot account before the corresponding time; if they fail to close and transfer out in time, the platform will be based on the market price at that time Automatic liquidation and settlement, and transfer of assets to spot accounts; unfilled orders will be automatically cancelled by the system.\n3. You can freely switch between old and new futures through the navigation top floating layer. After you click [Switch new/old version], you will switch simultaneously when you access futures transactions, futures assets, futures orders, and futures-related operation functions; please note that the old and new versions of the futures Data is not interoperable;\nThe affected functions include but are not limited to: futures broker, futures experience fee, futures documentary, futures contest;\n4. Your futures assets need to be transferred to the spot account before being transferred to the futures account;";
