"trade_market_title"="A market order is executed at the current market price as quickly as possible when a user places the market order.";
"trade_market_title_sub"="Illustration";
"trade_market_title_2"="The current price is 2400. If you place a market order, your order will be filled with rival price immediately,it means the average filled price won't be equal to 2400(A), which is supposed to be a bit lower or higher than 2400.";
"trade_market_title_3"="For buy orders, the average filled price might be a bit higher than current price. And for sell orders, the average filled price might be a bit lower than current price.";

"trade_limit_title"="A Limit order is to buy or sell at a specific price or better.Limit orders are not guaranteed to execute.";
"trade_limit_chart_a"="A- Current Price";
"trade_limit_chart_b"="B/C- Limit Price";
"trade_limit_title_sell_2"="When the Current Price (A) increases to the sell order's Limit Price(B) or above,the order will execute automatically. The order might be filled immediately if the selling price is below or equal to the current price. Therefore, the selling price of limit orders must be above the current price.";
"trade_limit_title_sell_3"="For example：\n1）The current price in the above graph is 2400 (A),if a new sell limit order is placed with Limit Price 3000 (B), the order will not execute until the price increases to 3000(B) or above.\n2）Instead, if the sell limit order is placed with Limit Price 1500(C),which is below the current price, the order would be filled with the rival price immediately; the filled price is around 2400,not 1500.";
"trade_limit_title_buy_2"="When the Current Price (A) drops to the buy order's Limit Price (C) or below, the order will execute automatically. The order will be filled immediately if the buying price is above or equal to the current price. Therefore, the buying price of limit orders must be below the current price.";
"trade_limit_title_buy_3"="For example：\n1）The current price in the above graph is 2400 (A). If a new buy limit order is placed with Limit price 1500 (C), the order will not execute until the price drops to 1500 (C) or below.\n2） Instead, if the buy limit order is placed with Limit price 3000(B),which is above the current price,the order will be filled with the rival price immediately. And the executed price is around 2400,not 3000.";
